/-!
# Qsag.Math.Algebra

Umbrella for the constructive algebra library. It declares nothing; import a part directly when
only that part is needed.

* `Qsag.Math.Counting` — list and finite-sum combinatorics (`qsum`, Johnson set systems);
* `Qsag.Math.CoeffPoly` — coefficient-list polynomials, linear solver, Euclidean division;
* `Qsag.Math.PolyRing` — `UPoly` / `Poly3` rings, determinants, isomorphisms, fraction fields;
* `Qsag.Math.HasseHensel` — Hasse–Taylor calculus, Hensel lifting, jets, interpolation.
-/
